# Components

## shadcn/ui
- Use installed shadcn/ui primitives from `src/components/ui` first.
- Compose screens from existing shadcn blocks and app components before creating new primitives.
- Avoid editing `src/components/ui` unless a generated component needs a small compatibility fix.
- Add registry items with `bun run shadcn:add -- <item>`.

## Workrate Shell
- Keep `public/logo.svg` as the sidebar logo unless asked otherwise.
- Keep sidebar and topbar alignment pixel-clean.
- Keep dashboard styling restrained, dense, and operational.
- Avoid marketing-page hero sections in this repo.

## Component Style
- Prefer small, focused components.
- Use `@/` imports for internal files.
- Use `cn()` from `src/lib/utils.ts` for conditional classes.
- Use lucide-react icons for UI actions.
- Keep text fitting cleanly on desktop and mobile.

## Routes
- Route files live in `src/routes/` and are managed by TanStack Router.
- Shared screen components live in `src/components/`.
- Keep the start page useful; do not add intro/landing screens unless requested.
